{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["White Algae is an item which can be caught with a ",["l","工具","Fishing Pole"]," during all seasons at any underground location (Floors 20 & 60 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", ",["l","下水道","the Sewers"],", the ",["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"],", or the ",["l","巫婆沼泽","Witch's Swamp"],")."]],["p",["White Algae can also be dropped by several ",["l","怪物","Monsters"],": ",["l","蛆","Grub"],"s, ",["l","突变蛆","Mutant Grub"],"s, ",["l","苍蝇","Flies"],", ",["l","突变苍蝇","Mutant Flies"],", ",["l","臭虫","Bug"],"s, and Red, Purple, Copper, and Iron ",["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Slimes"],". A ",["l","鬼鱼","Ghostfish"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 5 White Algae when the population of the pond reaches 9."]],["p",["White Algae is displayed in the ",["l","收集品","Fish section"]," of the ",["l","收集品","collection"]," tab, and counts towards the four fishing ",["l","钓鱼","Achievements"],". However, it is otherwise not considered to be a fish, and therefore cannot be sold to ",["l","威利","Willy"]," at the ",["l","鱼店","Fish Shop"],", does not benefit from fish price bonuses, cannot be used in place of \"Any Fish\" in ",["l","烹饪","recipes"],", and cannot be put in a ",["l","鱼饵制造机","Bait Maker"],", ",["l","熏鱼机","Fish Smoker"],", or ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯",